{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>WELCOME, TO:</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922260/extras/13d0506afe0d717d55010efc5f0e0e85.avif?t=1767888250\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">_________________</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>ACATALEPSY</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>The most immersive multiplayer liminal space experience.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Somehow, some way, you've ended up in a liminal hell. Complete various tasks and dive deeper through several levels. With a procedural level generation system, the map is different and unique every single time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">_________________</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>YOU ARE <u>NOT</u> ALONE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You and your team are not the only ones populating the liminal spaces. Alongside completing your missions, you'll need to avoid various monsters that lurk within the level. Coming face-to-face with a creature here will mean certain death.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">_________________</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A <i>BRIEF</i> SOLACE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Once you have completed the threshold of tasks and your team has successfully exited a level, you will be presented with an interlude phase. Here, you can view the status of your team, lives remaining, and sell and purchase equipment. All deceased team members will come back, but at the cost of a life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">_________________</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922260/extras/ae1b39ed45afebd686677d328f9a7f0f.avif?t=1767888250\" width=748 height=896 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3922260?t=1767888250","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922260/7a4c9ed8c7b2687b64378cb9ce7738c950bffd8e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767888250","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922260/be467c19c7144bcb94f6ec5934a3f61c2d896e3f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767888250","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922260/be467c19c7144bcb94f6ec5934a3f61c2d896e3f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767888250","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Interlude screens between levels also feature dead players with varying amounts of violence and disturbing imagery."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>WELCOME, TO:</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922260/extras/13d0506afe0d717d55010efc5f0e0e85.avif?t=1767888250\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">_________________</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>ACATALEPSY</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>The most immersive multiplayer liminal space experience.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Somehow, some way, you've ended up in a liminal hell. Complete various tasks and dive deeper through several levels. With a procedural level generation system, the map is different and unique every single time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">_________________</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>YOU ARE <u>NOT</u> ALONE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You and your team are not the only ones populating the liminal spaces. Alongside completing your missions, you'll need to avoid various monsters that lurk within the level. Coming face-to-face with a creature here will mean certain death.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">_________________</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A <i>BRIEF</i> SOLACE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Once you have completed the threshold of tasks and your team has successfully exited a level, you will be presented with an interlude phase. Here, you can view the status of your team, lives remaining, and sell and purchase equipment. All deceased team members will come back, but at the cost of a life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">_________________</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922260/extras/ae1b39ed45afebd686677d328f9a7f0f.avif?t=1767888250\" width=748 height=896 /></span></p>","developers":["Heavy_Tankr"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922260/1d2c405a7599bba72c4a751612af76f72d12f4a0/header.jpg?t=1767888250","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Uses the Procedural